      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T08:46:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should replace these with two booleans, m{Start,Stop}LegacyVpnCalled.\n\nIf I\u0027m reading this correctly, the test is entirely single-threaded and the synchronization is not actually useful, so it gives a false sense that it is necessary. In fact, by my reading correctness depends on the single-threaded-ness because nothing would prevent the thread running expectStartLegacyVpnRunner from being pre-empted immediately before l.1219 and while it\u0027s sleeping any call to {expectS,s}topLegacyVpnRunner doesn\u0027t produce the expected results.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1068,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1069,
        "endChar": 77
      },
      "revId": "d516f9e003858db670f0b85e9ff7690168b202d9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "06e03497_8545c220",
        "filename": "tests/net/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityServiceTest.java",
