      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T08:08:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that would require a large amount of refactoring I think.\n\nLegacyVpnRunner cannot be constructed by the Dependencies class, because Dependencies is a static class but LegacyVpnRunner is a non-static class which uses Vpn member variables (mConfig, mObserver, mDeps, ...) and methods (updateState, agentConnect, prepareStatusIntent, ...).",
