      "message": "Is this absolutely necessary for your test ? I\u0027d like not to depend on this permission any more than we already do, because this will add work when we finally get to make it ignored. Would NETWORK_SETTINGS or NETWORK_STACK serve your purpose here ?\n\n(edit : I see that you\u0027re only moving it from l.6269, but if it\u0027s possible to use some other permission that we don\u0027t intend to ignore as soon as possible, it would still be better)",
