      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T06:56:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this will always pass after l.6940, right?\nPer documentation, \nAny threads that later approach block() will not block unless close() is called.\nAnd we didn\u0027t call close().",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6966,
