      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T08:08:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch! stopVpnRunnerPrivileged and expectStopVpnRunnerPrivileged don\u0027t do anything to reset mStartLegacyVpnCv, so in effect, expectStartLegacyVpnRunner() will never do anything at all after the first time it\u0027s called. Fixed, I think, by reinitializing mStartLegacyVpnCv in stopVpnRunnerPrivileged.",
