      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T08:46:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It will not \"always\" pass because of l.1227.\n\nBut in this case I think this comment is very relevant ; would by any chance mVpnRunner be already null when stopVpnRunnerPrivileged is called ?\n\nIn particular I am surprised by the lines immediately below. Wifi is not blocked, and also we receive an update to the caps of the VPN before LOST of the VPN. I don\u0027t understand why you\u0027d need to call establish again in l.6985 if startLegacyVpnRunner had been called again without any disconnection inbetween.",
      "parentUuid": "6d800a34_4f000bf2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6966,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 6966,
        "endChar": 46
      },
      "revId": "d516f9e003858db670f0b85e9ff7690168b202d9",
