      "writtenOn": "2021-01-18T14:00:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure why this is. I think the problem might be that when the callback is sent the VPN is still connected. But the fact that a VPN is connected should only unblock the VPN, not any other network. I\u0027m starting to suspect a bug in isUidBlockedByVpn testNetworkBlockedStatusAlwaysOnVpn is supposed to check that, but I don\u0027t think it has coverage for what happens to non-VPN blocked status when a VPN connects.",
      "parentUuid": "4196b8f6_49b7f6eb",
